r productivity 40 percent, to using generative artificial intelligence (AI) to streamline passenger record processes and save months of manual effort. With services such as Amazon Bedrock, AWS IoT Core, and Amazon DocumentDB, United Airlines is transforming passenger experiences, increasing efficiency and security, and shaping the intelligent airport of tomorrow.","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/united-airlines-innovator-card.b02c9f5e0f9d9f22f3d53377da0ebe6e256ce598.jpeg","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/united-airlines-logo.5700166296d2216b5abdb3666484a1866fcf6504.png","displayLocation":"Americas","customerNameLower":"united airlines","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransforming passenger experiences, increasing efficiency and security, and shaping the intelligent airport of tomorrow.\u003c/p\u003e\n","industry":"Travel","sortDate":"2024-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/innovators/united-airlines/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"United Airlines","publishedDate":"2024","enableShare":"1","headline":"United Airlines on AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","lo