ng displayed in an Innovator-specific prefiltered Directory.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2024-06-14T22:12:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-06-14T22:12:04+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Hospitality","description":"Hospitality","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:05+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"hospitality","description":"Hospitality","dateCreated":"2020-03-23T20:15:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-01-26T00:37:15+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#travel","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"travel","description":"Travel","dateCreated":"2020-05-29T23:12:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-02-09T21:53:22+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#travel-and-hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"travel-and-hospitality","description":"\u003cp\u003eAs of 4/2023, this tag is initially being used specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#accor-innovator","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"accor-innovator","dateCreated":"2024-06-28T07:22:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-08-07T18:41:50+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Accor hotels group strives to go above and beyond its customers’ expectations and provide each of them with inspiring and personalized experiences. To achieve this, the hotels group is supported by Amazon Web Services (AWS) technologies and uses scalable cloud solutions, along with smart Internet of Things devices which run on Artificial Intelligence (AI). Accor hosts millions of traveling customers in 5,200 hotels in 110 countries around the world, with the capacity to open one hew hotel every day.","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/accor_innovator.e42013ce8b1a31327a12eb01c9ca7bb514926e7c.png","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/accor%20logo%401x.f54daa83d222f1b02f62b4d673ff1107bb2af35b.png","displayLocation":"France","customerNameLower":"accor","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eImproving personalized hotel experiences and strengthening customer loyalty.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n","industry":"Hospitality","sortDate":"2024-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/innovators/accor/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Accor","publishedDate":"2024","enableShare":"1","headline":"Accor on AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#sagemaker","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon SageMaker","description":"Amazon SageMaker","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-0