s Contact Center Performance with Amazon Connect","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#philippines","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Philippines","description":"Philippines","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:37+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#contact-center","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Contact Center","description":"Contact Center","dateCreated":"2022-11-23T06:58:38+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-11-23T06:58:38+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#connect","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Connect","description":"Amazon Connect","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#business-apps","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Business Applications","description":"Business Applications","dateCreated":"2020-08-20T04:22:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Analytics","description":"Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#business-category#cust-engagement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#business-category","name":"Customer Engagement","description":"Customer Engagement","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T07:06:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#quicksight","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon QuickSight","description":"Amazon QuickSight","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:55+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#asean","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"ASEAN","description":"ASEAN","dateCreated":"2020-08-20T03:53:05+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:35+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#apac","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Asia Pacific","description":"Asia Pacific","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:35+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#prof-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Professional Services","description":"Professional Services","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:07:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:08+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#business-apps","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Business Applications","description":"Business Applications","dateCreated":"2022-10-07T04:56:33+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-10-07T04:56:33+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#customer-engagement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Customer Engagement","description":"Customer Engagement","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-21T23:37:45+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#big-data-analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","description":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:36+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#hospital-sirio-libanes-case-study-from-pt-directory","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"hospital-sirio-libanes-case-study-from-pt-directory","dateCreated":"2024-02-03T03:48:32+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-06T01:35:36+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Com uma área construída de aproximadamente 100 mil m² no bairro da Bela Vista, em São Paulo, além de um hospital de alta complexidade em Brasília, o Hospital Sírio-Libanês atende mais de 60 especialidades e conta com mais de 500 leitos. A instituição alia um corpo clínico multidisciplinar a tecnologias de última geração. Ao longo dos anos, acumulou conquistas pioneiras, como a inauguração da primeira Unidade de Terapia Intensiva (UTI) no Brasil, em 1971, e a participação na primeira tele cirurgia guiada por robô realizada no hemisfério Sul, em 2000.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/hospital-sirio-libanes%402x.d48972885f39f72ec6a6500927dc8dec85524046.png","displayLocation":"Brasil","customerNameLower":"hospital sírio libanês","footerInfoText":"Data de publicação","industry":"Saúde","sortDate":"2023-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/pt/solutions/case-studies/hospital-sirio-libanes-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Hospital Sírio Libanês","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2023","contentType":"História do cliente","headline":"Sírio Libanês transforma sua gestão financeira de nuvem em 5 meses"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cost-usage-report","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Cost and Usage Report","description":"AWS Cost and Usage Report","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:27+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#big-data-analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","description":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:36+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#security-hub","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLO