ar y estandarizar los datos, lo que ayudó a respaldar el crecimiento de la empresa y aceleró la entrega de herramientas internas de toma de decisiones basadas en datos.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/northius-logo%401x.0a42fee74acc68143c692512a9c9b0a47c4eaaa4.png","displayLocation":"Spain","customerNameLower":"northius","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Education","sortDate":"2023-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/northius-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Northius","publishedDate":"2023","enableShare":"1","headline":"Northius centraliza y estandariza los datos de toda la empresa en un esfuerzo de modernización con AWS Lake Formation","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#migration-transfer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Migration \u0026 Transfer","description":"Migration \u0026 Transfer","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#spanish","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Spanish","description":"Spanish","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#vpc","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon VPC","description":"Amazon VPC","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:06:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:06+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#iberia","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Iberia","description":"Iberia","dateCreated":"2020-04-09T03:37:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:49+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking