description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#big-data-analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","description":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:36+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#jump","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"jump","dateCreated":"2023-07-17T23:44:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-08-11T22:26:57+0000","additionalFields":{"videoSrcUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003d6Uq9Qvtzitw","descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eJump facilite le quotidien des personnes souhaitant devenir freelances en leur proposant de les embaucher en CDI - tout en restant leur propre patron sans avoir \u0026agrave; g\u0026eacute;rer le volet administratif. Sebastian CACERES, CTO chez Jump, partage l\u0026rsquo;ambition de multiplier par 5 le nombre de salari\u0026eacute;s freelances d\u0026rsquo;ici fin 2022. Sa probl\u0026eacute;matique principale : rester proche des clients en proposant une disponibilit\u0026eacute; en continue et une structure pour ses utilisateurs. Le Cloud AWS a su fournir les fonctionnalit\u0026eacute;s permettant \u0026agrave; Jump de r\u0026eacute;pondre \u0026agrave; ses besoins de haute disponibilit\u0026eacute;, flexibilit\u0026eacute;, scalabilit\u0026eacute; et de s\u0026eacute;curit\u0026eacute; pour un investissement moindre en amont. Le passage au cloud a eu pour effet d\u0026rsquo;offrir plus d\u0026rsquo;agilit\u0026eacute; \u0026agrave; Jump en leur permettant de faire du test and learn gr\u0026acirc;ce aux diff\u0026eacute;rentes fonctionnalit\u0026eacute;s et services propos\u0026eacute;s. Jump souhaite aller plus loin et s\u0026rsquo;int\u0026eacute;resse aujourd\u0026rsquo;hui \u0026agrave; l\u0026rsquo;architecture bas\u0026eacute;e sur des \u0026eacute;v\u0026eacute;nements, la scalabilit\u0026eacute; et les services \u0026agrave; l\u0026rsquo;\u0026eacute;chelle mondiale.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","featureImageURL":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6Uq9Qvtzitw/maxresdefault.jpg","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/%c3%89tude%20de%20cas%20AWS%20%20Jump.ba964f2b5a82506027f093a6dd39620de314eb70.jpg","displayLocation":"France","customerNameLower":"jump","footerInfoText":"Date de publication","industry":"Services professionnels","sortDate":"2022-06-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/fr/solutions/case-studies/jump/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Jump","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Témoignages clients","headline":"Jump : Une solution innovante pour les freelances en recherche d’une proximité client toujours plus forte"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#elasticache","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon ElastiCache","description":"Amazon ElastiCache","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T00:13:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lightsail","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Lightsail","description":"Amazon Lightsail","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:47+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#gamelift","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon GameLift","description":"Amazon GameLift","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:36+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#prod