ption":"\u003cp\u003eAs of 4/2023, this tag is initially being used specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#lecab","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"lecab","dateCreated":"2023-07-18T00:06:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-18T00:18:08+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eChampion de la mobilit\u0026eacute; d\u0026rsquo;entreprise et au service d\u0026rsquo;une client\u0026egrave;le exigeante, LeCab mise sur Amazon Web Services (AWS) depuis bient\u0026ocirc;t 10 ans. D\u0026rsquo;abord CTO puis Directeur de l\u0026rsquo;Innovation au sein de cette startup 100% fran\u0026ccedil;aise, Fran\u0026ccedil;ois Masclef revient sur les challenges num\u0026eacute;riques de la soci\u0026eacute;t\u0026eacute; et les apports de AWS en mati\u0026egrave;re de business intelligence sur l\u0026rsquo;ensemble de leur infrastructure.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/1576747127878.8cbef33193ae35644bcf2044cf8a63375392e46e.da5544f8b05fd332d67a818a7b85b6526a8f2513.png","displayLocation":"Europe, Moyen-Orient et Afrique","footerInfoText":"Date de publication","industry":"Services professionnels","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/fr/solutions/case-studies/lecab/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"Témoignages clients","customer-name":"LeCab","headline":"Business Intelligence : LeCab passe à la vitesse supérieure grâce à AWS : Découvrez comment la startup française de VTC a réduit ses coûts par 3 et multiplié sa vitesse de déploiement par 4"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#big-data-analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","description":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:36+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudwatch","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon CloudWatch","description":"Amazon CloudWatch","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#startup","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Startup (SUP)","description":"Startup (SUP)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:16+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#codepipeline","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS CodePipeline","description":"AWS CodePipeline","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:13+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:25+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#startup","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Startup","description":"Startup","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-15T04:54:51+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#europe","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe","description":"Europe","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#prof-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Professional Services","desc